From: govi-nokia <govindaraj.haridass@nokia.com>
Date: Sat, 5 Sep 2026 18:56:50 +0530
Subject: [PATCH]     Persist extra lldpd neighbor, chassis, and statistics
 fields for OpenConfig LLDP.

    Write TTL, PVID, max-frame-size, custom TLVs, MED serial, and link-aggregation
    into APPL_DB, scrape lldpcli statistics into COUNTERS_DB LLDP_STATISTICS, and
    decode lldpd capability aliases including Wlan and Station.

    Signed-off-by: govi-nokia <govindaraj.haridass@nokia.com>
